  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Negotiating groundwater extractions in the Mekong Delta &#x2013; Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2023 and 2024, a first phase of the groundwater negotiations project was organised together with Can Tho University. This project implemented a, for Vietnam, new approach to stakeholder involvement by developing and utilizing a serious game to facilitate group discussions on using groundwater and the issues that arise with it. This assignment builds on the lessons learned and recommendations from phase 1 to consolidate and expand the approach in the Mekong Delta, discuss the issue of freshwater availability with new communities, train additional game moderators, and discuss tangible solutions the growing problems communities are facing.</narrative>
  </description>
